{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "53403ffab3ae470ee0a64686afa4e537a845285662a09e4d8eaa6ca1620d0e3c", "ja": "（星梨花達のユニットのPVが、無事完成した。\nファンの人達も、きっと喜んでくれるだろう）", "zh": "（星梨花她们组合的PV顺利完成了。\n粉丝们肯定也会很高兴吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "31f21bd350f63643086747f3949b35a403c4eaa6fdf86af5d0a782e279739f1d", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\nいま、お話しても大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n现在方便和您聊聊吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7119bad7e6b4785a97d488435b812aeeb556424c9a3bc79b13c161bf69390bb3", "ja": "お疲れ様、星梨花。\n大丈夫だけど、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，星梨花。\n没关系，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "6e8c1a04615fb8d5f0f065243a48e4323260cebaedacfa10734323f3615d25a2", "ja": "はい！　実は、わたし……\n秘密にしたいことが、できたんです！", "zh": "是的！其实，我……\n有了想要保密的事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9959045bf20780a78c8f65e54e7b2cecedff6735ec58f9be5f0605cb239197e0", "ja": "えっ！？\n……本当なのか、星梨花。", "zh": "诶！？\n……真的吗，星梨花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "52f061a6a7d0da655a77f30f725ca37107151301a8347cb3405b06e5bf2aabf9", "ja": "はい！　あっ、でも、そんなにすごい秘密じゃない\nので、ガッカリさせちゃうかもしれませんけど……。", "zh": "是的！啊，不过这不是什么了不起的秘密，可能会让您失望……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "ed544a3bef0feed172eadc7e578a04a7f6ba536fbb64741914e169c1438e62db", "ja": "でもわたしにも、内緒にしておきたいことが\nあったんです。なんだかうれしくて……えへへ。", "zh": "不过，我也有想要保密的事情。总觉得好开心……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "2358acabd7d3af321d633cfd219674c9964efeaaaa03fe97a47c66e8b068f6dc", "ja": "なので、{$P$}さんに\n一番に言いにきたんですよ。", "zh": "所以，我第一时间就来告诉{$P$}先生了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1008_p", "source_sha256": "527f7cf1e73ed512ca5817282d323b1c1756136c93741d6f2b7280eb2fbfe348", "ja": "そうか。星梨花が内緒にしておきたい事……\n改めて言われると、なんだか気になるな。", "zh": "这样啊。星梨花想要保密的事……\n被你这么一说，反倒让人在意起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "8d80949694300e24cebb32ae39a5337fbe0013164323bf6d090a6f2d00af425b", "ja": "えっ？　だ、ダメですよ{$P$}さん！\nせっかく、秘密ができたばっかりなんですよ。", "zh": "诶？不、不行啦，{$P$}先生！\n好不容易才刚有了秘密。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "242c55baa4c1ace1662f5b1bd21a19fd74ac053fb0ef4fd025b1886f4e075f43", "ja": "いくら{$P$}さんでも、\nこれだけは教えられません！", "zh": "就算是{$P$}先生，\n这件事也不能告诉你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d11a4baf9ae6c8f070e385591d2f6cad542beba1f6c281e67e0fab1139b0ba5f", "ja": "そうだな……でもプロデューサーとしては、\n担当アイドルの事は知っておきたいというか……。", "zh": "是啊……不过，作为制作人，总还是想了解一下自己负责的偶像……怎么说呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "16c33e9279ab29e52a385e6d56ff719440dc82f0500533205bb35265f2b306ae", "ja": "えっ……あ、そうですよね。もしかして、\nお仕事に支障が出ちゃったりとかするのかも……？", "zh": "诶……啊，说得也是呢。这样的话，说不定会影响工作……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "94c09ae27641321541086ab4657200c4d7cf9ee01fdb432d1a880047753409a7", "ja": "うう、どうしましょう……？", "zh": "呜呜，该怎么办才好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2e10428c74c2a5cdbb3b08f3626e67ee7001cb3fe3a78a7aa6787a8afc7c4cda", "ja": "はは……冗談だよ星梨花。他のみんなも秘密を\n持ってるんだから、星梨花も持っていて大丈夫だ！", "zh": "哈哈……开玩笑的，星梨花。其他人也都有自己的秘密，所以星梨花有秘密也没关系！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "171710413ec5b742d8e4594c45d5cdd452f623b42939da3e953b32cb1bf90a4b", "ja": "本当ですか？　それならよかったです！", "zh": "真的吗？那就太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "fe94cb940f24c606fbc2b8fb7dee03ebdef84715a92d205cae42442844b3d392", "ja": "でも{$P$}さん。秘密って、\nいつまで秘密にしていればいいんでしょう？", "zh": "但是，{$P$}先生。秘密到底要保守到什么时候才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b3d9e861f609c28d6740423552630b93cd3d0545bf8fd2756f9f361aeae9e18d", "ja": "そうだな。星梨花が「誰かに話してもいい」と\n思ったら、それはもう秘密じゃなくなるのかもな。", "zh": "嗯……如果星梨花觉得“可以告诉别人了”，那或许就不再是秘密了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "9b94af5afee460ef83c30b98a7b3d1c4cb1977f8d4b6630fc29de60c7428e246", "ja": "わたしが、話していいと思ったら……\nそうなんですね。わかりました！", "zh": "如果我觉得可以告诉别人……原来是这样。我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "26fb2e4859fcad84cd4f0966a55909a2a70e3d53ba9071d3db1d9b29b3802da6", "ja": "じゃあその時は、{$P$}さんに\n話しにきますね。", "zh": "那到时候，我会来{$P$}先生找您聊天的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0173_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "7d3cf523dd09966f3c40da0fa3fb67232e1e27aa14c58d5640413dda900bcbd6", "ja": "その時は、わたしの秘密のお話、聞いてくださいね！\n約束ですよ？　ふふっ♪", "zh": "到时候，请听听我的秘密哦！\n说好了哦？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
